"quantity.<br /> There are a wide range of units to choose from and different "
"methods to specify quantities.</p>\n"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Nuclear calculator<br /></span>This calculator makes use of "
"the nuclear data available in Kalzium to predict-</li>\n"
