"indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"> half-lives</li>\n"
"<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">expected masses of a "
